Package: yt-unsub-detector
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssl
Description: YouTube subscription marker browser extension
 Installs the English-language YT Unsub Detector extension for Chrome and
 Chromium on Linux. APT registers the extension automatically; restart the
 browser after installation. The extension highlights channels you are not
 subscribed to, tracks unsubscribes, and optionally syncs that history
 through Google Drive.
 .
 Google Drive configuration is stored per user under
 ~/.config/yt-unsub-detector, outside the extension package. Run
 yt-unsub-detector config as your desktop user to create or locate the files.
